abstract: >-
  Sol Next 9.0.4 (Dawn Orbit, ai.sol.next, Build 904) is a brand-new, independent,
  open-source voice+text multimodal Android 10-16/17 & HarmonyOS AI mobile agent.
  It features global 20-language UI with strict phone-language auto-detection
  (including Arabic RTL), free built-in DeepSeek V4.1 Flash sealed inside a pure-Rust
  JNI ChaCha20+HMAC-SHA256+HKDF vault bound to APK Sig Block v2/v3 signing cert
  SHA-256 with TLS SPKI pinning and universal BYOK override, auto-popup OTA updates
  with release notes and 4-stream parallel HTTP Range mirror acceleration, Wi-Fi-off
  persistent Wireless Debugging Shell Helper, built-in 16KB offline neural ASR & 112ms
  TTS, 72ms Tier-0A native System APIs, 120+ app deep-link teleports, 1:1 physical-DPI
  background VirtualDisplay, Android 17 Generative UI cards, carrier-grade AI calling,
  and zero-dependency CLI (--json) + stdio MCP Server integration.
